{"translation":{"id":"aii_abt","name":"ܕܝܬܩܐ ܚܕܬܐ ܕܡܪܢ ܝܫܘܥ ܡܫܝܚܐ ܘܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ ܒܠܫܢܐ ܐܬܘܪܝܐ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=aii","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"ABT","englishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic NT+Psalms","language":"aii","textDirection":"rtl","sha256":"1859152dbbffe55d2b7ac6d4c09fbad5a6416ca25359e69220bb358dac602444","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/books.json","numberOfBooks":28,"totalNumberOfChapters":410,"totalNumberOfVerses":10420,"languageName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic","languageEnglishName":"Assyrian Neo-Aramaic"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"aii_abt","name":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","commonName":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","title":"ܡܙܡܘܪ̈ܐ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"08b7c4463dda6adc56b2c377f42d67ace350af655720940a2e395776a718fc6c","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":62,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ܠܪܝܫ ܓܘܕܐ ܕܙܡܪ̈ܐ. ܥܠܔ ܝܕܘܬܘܢ. ܡܙܡܘܪܐ ܕܕܘܝܕ."]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ܐܲܚܟ̰ܝܼ ܠܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܒܫܸܬܩܵܐ ܒܸܣܦܵܪܵܐ ܝܠܵܗ̇ ܓܵܢܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܡܸܢܹܗ ܝܠܹܗ ܦܘܼܪܩܵܢܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܚܟ̰ܝܼ ܗ̇ܘ ܝܼܠܹܗ ܐܝܼܨܵܪܝܼ ܘܦܘܼܪܩܵܢܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܲܠܥܝܼ ܝܠܹܗ، ܗܲܪ ܠܹܐ ܫܵܥܫܹܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗܲܠܔ ܐܝܼܡܲܢ ܒܸܬ ܬܵܪܥܝܼܬܘܿܢ ܥܲܠܔ ܐܢܵܫܵܐ؟","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܠܵܘܟ݂ܘܿܢ ܒܵܥܹܝܬܘܿܢ ܠܸܩܛܵܠܵܐ ܐܸܠܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܝܟ݂ ܓܘܼܕܵܐ ܓܸܢܝܵܐ، ܣܝܵܓ݂ܵܐ ܚܘܼܪܙܸܦܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܚܟ̰ܝܼ ܥܒ݂ܝܼܕ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܡܸܠܟܵܐ ܠܸܛܪܵܕܹܗ ܡ̣ܢ ܪܵܡܘܼܬܹܗ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܟܹܐ ܒܵܣܡܵܐ ܠܗܘܿܢ ܒܕܘܼܓܠܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܦܘܼܡܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܟܹܐ ܒܲܪܟ݂ܝܼ، ܐܝܼܢܵܐ ܒܓܵܘܵܝܗ‌ܝ ܟܹܐ ܠܵܝܛܝܼ. ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܚܟ̰ܝܼ ܠܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܒܫܸܬܩܵܐ ܣܦܘܿܪܝ، ܝܵܐ ܓܵܢܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܵܒܵܒ ܡܸܢܹܗ ܝܠܹܗ ܣܲܒ݂ܪܝܼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܚܟ̰ܝܼ ܗ̇ܘ ܝܼܠܹܗ ܐܝܼܨܵܪܝܼ ܘܦܘܼܪܩܵܢܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܩܲܠܥܝܼ ܝܠܹܗ، ܠܹܐ ܫܵܥܫܹܢ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܲܠܔ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܦܘܼܪܩܵܢܝܼ ܘܐܝܼܩܵܪܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܗ̇ܘ ܝܼܠܹܗ ܐܝܼܨܵܪܵܐ ܕܥܘܼܫܢܝܼ، ܒܹܝܬ ܓܵܘܣܝܼ ܒܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܣܒܘܿܪܘܼܢ ܒܝܼܹܗ ܒܟܠܔ ܙܲܒ݂ܢܵܐ، ܝܵܐ ܥܲܡܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܫܲܦܟ݂ܘܼܢ ܩܲܕܡܘܼܗ‌ܝ ܠܸܒܵܘܟ݂ܘܿܢ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ ܒܹܝܬ ܓܵܘܣܵܐ ܝܠܹܗ ܩܵܬܲܢ. ܣܹܠܵܗ","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܫܲܪܝܼܪܵܐܝܼܬ، ܣܪܝܼܩܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ ܝܢܵܐ ܒܢܲܝ̈ ܐܵܕܵܡ، ܕܘܼܓܠܵܐ ܝܢܵܐ ܒܢܲܝ̈ܢܵܫܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܲܠܔ ܡܲܣܲܐܬܵ‌ܐ ܟܹܐ ܐܵܣܩܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܵܢܝܼ ܥܲܠܔ ܚܕܵܕܹ̈ܐ ܒܘܼܫ ܩܲܠܘܼ̈ܠܹܐ ܝܢܵܐ ܡ̣ܢ ܢܫܲܡܬܵ‌ܐ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܠܵܐ ܡܲܬܒ݂ܝܼܬܘܿܢ ܣܲܒ݂ܪܵܐ ܥܲܠܔ ܛܠܘܼܡܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܒܚܛܘܼܦܝܵܐ ܠܵܐ ܗܵܘܝܼ ܠܵܘܟ݂ܘܿܢ ܬܘܼܟ݂ܠܵܢܵܐ ܣܪܝܼܩܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܥܘܼܬܪܵܐ ܟܲܕ ܙܵܐܹܕ، ܠܵܐ ܡܲܬܒ݂ܝܼܬܘܿܢ ܠܸܒܵܐ ܥܲܠܘܼܗ‌ܝ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܚܕܵܐ ܓܵܗܵܐ ܗܘܼܡܙܸܡ ܠܹܗ ܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܐܲܢܹܐ ܬܲܪܬܹܝ ܫܡܝܼܥ ܠܝܼ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܕܚܲܝܠܵܐ ܝܼܠܹܗ ܕܐܲܠܵܗܵܐ،","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܘܕܝܼܘܼܟ݂ ܝܼܠܵܗ̇ ܛܲܝܒܘܼܬܵ‌ܐ، ܝܵܐ ܡܵܪܝܵܐ،","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ܒܗ̇ܝ ܕܐܲܢ݇ܬ ܟܹܐ ܦܵܪܥܹܬ ܠܐܢܵܫܵܐ ܐܲܝܟ݂ ܦܘܼܠܚܵܢܹܗ.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/62.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/63.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/aii_abt/PSA/61.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}